# Made by make in each deck directory (README.md): the links into the
# framework, and the outputs. A deck that commits its own _quarto.yml
# un-ignores it here.
/*/_quarto.yml
/*/_extensions
/*/_ncar
/*/.quarto/
/*/_qa/
/*/*_files/
/*/*.pptx
/*/*.pdf
/*/*.html
~$*

# A deck's data/ is frozen input it commits, not the local working data the
# repo-wide `data/` rule is for.
!/*/data/
